{
  "version": 1,
  "note": [
    "Registrable domain -> category. Shipped with the extension and applied first by the",
    "resolver; keyword rules then 'unknown' handle the rest, and a user override always wins.",
    "",
    "This map is deliberately GENERIC. It was seeded from one person's browsing but contains",
    "only domains a large population uses. Employer, school, local government, neighbourhood",
    "businesses and personal accounts are excluded on purpose: this file is public, and a",
    "domain list is a profile. Those resolve to 'unknown' and the user categorises them",
    "locally if they want to.",
    "",
    "'unknown' is a valid category and never appears as a value here - it is what the resolver",
    "returns when nothing matches, not something a domain is assigned to."
  ],
  "categories": {
    "video": "Video and streaming services watched rather than read.",
